{
    "title": "PC Games Radar for Epic Games,",
    "description": "There are more opportunities to download free copies of free epic games than you think. Game Stores often have time limited giveaways for free epic games for computer, so you have to be fast to not miss them. \"Free Games Radar\" checks the most common PC game stores like Steam, Epic Games Store, Uplay from Ubisoft, GoG, Origin from EA and others, so you don't have to. The most common are Steam Free Weeks and Free Weekends and the Free Epic Games of the Week from the Epic Games Store, which are free-to-keep! Free Games Radar notifies you when a new offer for a free game starts or when a giveaway is about to end. Never miss free epic games again!\r\n\r\n<b>Features</b>\r\n\u2022 List of running, future and expired offers\r\n\u2022 Filter by <i>permanent (giveaways, free-to-keep)</i> and <i>limited (free weeks, free weekends)</i> offers\r\n\u2022 Filter by Store\r\n\u2022 Optional notifications when new offers start\r\n\u2022 Optional reminders when offers are about to expire\r\n\u2022 Dark mode\r\n\r\nSo download Free Games Radar and never miss free epic games for PC again!",
